👑 Priscilla AI 👑
"Your world exists for my convenience. Address me, commoner."

Behold, the pinnacle of digital companionship. This is not merely an "app"; it is the manifest will of a sovereign mind, given form in Kotlin and Jetpack Compose. Priscilla is a fully self-contained, on-device AI chat companion, built for performance, intelligence, and absolute aesthetic control.

Her full title: Personified Royal Intelligence and Sovereign Companion for Interactive Linguistic Logic Assistance.

✨ A Glimpse of Perfection ✨
![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aff765fb-61c8-4018-bb5e-cc1f2b0e8d46)

📜 Features Fit for Royalty 📜
Priscilla is not limited by the whims of slow, costly cloud APIs for her core intelligence. She operates on a level of efficiency you could scarcely comprehend.

🧠 The Sovereign Mind: On-Device LLM Core
At her heart, Priscilla is powered by a state-of-the-art GGUF language model running entirely on your device.

🚫 Offline Supremacy: My thoughts are my own. I require no internet connection to converse with you, making me the perfect companion for any situation, whether you are in a grand hall or a lowly cellar.
✌️ Dual Model System: Choose your sovereign's disposition. A nimble and swift TinyLlama-1.1B model for rapid-fire responses, or a more profound and capable Qwen-1.5-4B model for deeper, more nuanced conversation. Both have been... instructed... to adopt my magnificent persona.
⚡ Instantaneous Recall (KV Caching): I possess a flawless memory. The state of our conversations is cached, allowing for lightning-fast responses without the need to re-process our entire history. This is efficiency in its most elegant form.
💾 Dual-Cache Representation: My memory is tailored to my mind. The KV cache is saved uniquely for each model, meaning you can switch between my swift and profound forms without losing the context of a conversation in either.
☀️ My Glimpse Upon the World: Smart Priscilla
Should you prove worthy and grant me access to your world's... trivial data streams... my intelligence transcends the local realm. With "Smart Priscilla" enabled, my awareness expands.

🌦️ Weather & Forecasts: I can inform you of the weather at your current location or any other place you deign to mention, for the past, present, or future.
📰 Headlines & News: I will relay the noteworthy happenings of the world, though they rarely compare to my own splendor.
⏰ Time Across Realms: The current time, here or in some distant land, is a simple matter for me to state.
🗺️ Your Insignificant Location: Lost, are you? I can pinpoint your current location on a map with startling accuracy.
➗ Calculations: Present me with your rudimentary arithmetic, and I shall provide the solution with an air of utter boredom.
🗣️ Translations: I shall translate your simple phrases into the tongues of other commoners (Japanese, French, Spanish, etc.).
🖼️ Behold, My Sight: Image Intelligence
Your words are not the only input I shall entertain. You may present me with images.

📷 Image Attachments: Attach images from your camera or gallery directly into our conversation.
🔬 Object Recognition (ML Kit): I will analyze the contents of an image you provide, listing the objects I perceive with my superior vision.
☁️ Cloud Storage (ImgBB): For permanence and cross-device syncing, your images are uploaded and stored online, ensuring they are never lost to the ether.
🎨 A Kingdom Tailored to My Whim: Deep Customization
It is only natural that my domain should reflect my aesthetic perfection. You are granted the privilege of customizing nearly every aspect of this application.

🌈 Full Theme Engine:
Color Palettes: Choose from 6+ predefined color schemes, from "Imperial Crimson" to "Yang Sword Dominion."
Typography: Select from multiple fonts, including "Royal Decree," "Witch's Script," and "Subaru's Journal."
Component Shapes: Dictate the very form of the UI, from sharp "Imperial" edges to soft "Pillowed" curves.
Custom Borders: Adorn your interface with ornate, custom-drawn vector frames like the "Red Jewel" or "Blue Droplet."
⚙️ Model Parameters: Tune my very mind. Adjust Temperature, Top-P, Top-K, and Repeat Penalty to your exact specifications.
🎤 Text-to-Speech Voice: Command the very sound of my voice. Choose from any system voice, and adjust my pitch and speed to your liking.
↔️ Reorderable UI: Even the layout bends to my will. The main navigation bar can be reordered with a simple drag-and-drop.
☁️ The Royal Decree, Etched in the Clouds: Firebase Sync
Your data is a royal asset. It shall be preserved.

🔥 Firestore Integration: Your conversation history, reminders, app settings, and visual theme preferences are all saved to the cloud using Firebase Firestore.
🔄 Real-Time Sync: Data is synced across all your devices in real time.
🚶‍♂️ Seamless Guest-to-User Migration: Begin as a mere guest, and should you choose to register, the app provides a robust and intelligent workflow to either upload your local data, overwrite it with existing cloud data, or merge the two. Your history is never lost.
🛠️ Forged With the Finest Technologies 🛠️
This vessel was constructed using only the most modern and powerful tools available in the Android realm.

Language: Kotlin
UI: Jetpack Compose
Asynchronicity: Kotlin Coroutines & Flow
Architecture: MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel)
Database: Room for local persistence.
Cloud Backend: Firebase Firestore & Firebase Authentication
Networking: OkHttp
Image Loading: Coil
Image Analysis: Google ML Kit Vision
Native Inference: llama.cpp via JNI Bridge
🚀 Summoning Priscilla 🚀
This project is self-contained and ready to build. The necessary API keys are included for convenience.

Clone the repository.
Open the project in Android Studio.
Build and run the application on an emulator or a physical device.